<title>FINLAND: Finnish April PPI falls 1.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish April PPI falls 1.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index fell 1.1 percent in April year-on-year, and rose 0.2 percent month-on-month, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Monday.  </p>
<p>		  April 1997	   March 1997	April 1996</p>
<p>   Mth/Mth	+0.2 pct	   +/-0.0 pct	  -0.3 pct</p>
<p>   Yr/Yr	  -1.1 pct	     -1.6 pct	  +1.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
